{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>11月19日下午，國家主席習近平在深圳麒麟山莊同美國總統特朗普（Donald Trump，又譯川普）、俄羅斯總統普京（Vladimir Putin）舉行中美俄元首三方會談。</p><figure><img alt=\"深圳麒麟：三方會談場地。（01直播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200123940429631488473190.png/owxyR1gvxCxqYz0osjM4ygYGYtjsBd5hFjhb-hY4W_o\"/><figcaption>深圳麒麟：三方會談場地。（01直播截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:43:53.167906+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:26:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T08:37:18.542423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:37:18.542423+00:00","content_hash":"d4fc848a24c5595d99b7eb38fc1f09b3e84639cdb6b61e74458ee4415aa7ec43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}